@step 10
@slant 2
@bgcolor0 #f8f8ff
@bgcolor1 #f0f0f0

Req     ___@{s}~~~~@{e}___
Ack     _______@{a}~~~~

@-> (@{s}, @{a}) request
@-> (@{e}, @{a}, dashed) ack

Bus     =====@1X====@2X====@3
Flag    ____@4~~~~@5___

@-> (@1, @4, red, 2px) A
@-> (@2, @5, blue, head=both) B
@-> (@3, @4, green, dotted) forward ref

Data    __@{d1}~~~~@{d2}___
Out     ___@{o1}~~~~@{o2}__

@-> (@{d1}, @{o1}, #ff8800, solid) start
@-> (@{d2}, @{o2}, dashed, head=none) end
